/ The navigation and the select of the car, with each frame of the car page
  that a pick or a refresh loads, so each link keeps its timeframe, its chart
  and its car. Only the frame of the chart of the address renders it (see
  Cars::FrameNavigation).
- if navigation_frame?
  = turbo_stream_update_navigation

  - if car_select?
    = turbo_stream.update frame_id('car-select') do
      = render car_select_component
    = turbo_stream.update frame_id('car-select-chips') do
      = render car_select_component(chips: true)
